<section class="sv-section sv-section--warm">
  <div class="sv-container" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px;">
    <p class="sv-mono sv-muted">MAISON SERAVOLT  ·  MILAN / LONDON</p>
    <h1 class="sv-display-serif">Architecture you carry.</h1>
    <p class="sv-editorial-lead sv-muted" style="max-width: 740px;">
      Founded on a simple engineering premise: a single exquisitely crafted leather chassis should adapt to every chapter of your day without compromise, excess, or repacking.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sv-section">
  <div class="sv-container">
    <div class="sv-stats-3">
      <article class="sv-stat-card" style="padding: 32px; gap: 12px;" data-sv-reveal>
        <span class="sv-mono sv-brass">01</span>
        <h2 class="sv-section-title" style="font-size: 32px;">Architectural</h2>
        <p class="sv-body sv-muted">Reinforced Tuscan box calfskin volumes and hand-painted edge geometry engineered to hold clean posture empty or full.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="sv-stat-card" style="padding: 32px; gap: 12px;" data-sv-reveal>
        <span class="sv-mono sv-brass">02</span>
        <h2 class="sv-section-title" style="font-size: 32px;">Adaptive</h2>
        <p class="sv-body sv-muted">Zero-tool CNC-milled brass magnetic lock points let you swap handles, straps, and evening folios in one tactile click.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="sv-stat-card" style="padding: 32px; gap: 12px;" data-sv-reveal>
        <span class="sv-mono sv-brass">03</span>
        <h2 class="sv-section-title" style="font-size: 32px;">Enduring</h2>
        <p class="sv-body sv-muted">Every brass detent, strap clasp, and gusset lining is individually serviceable so your chassis ages across decades.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

